    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "ちょいちょい、どしたんタンホイザ～。\r\n頭なんか抱えちゃってさ。",
            "enText": "Hey now, what's wrong, Tannhauser?\nYou're practically tearing your hair out.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -2328332590406355040,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "マーベラス校舎計画でも立ててたの？\r\nそれとも矢文の練習をしたいの？\nどんな話でも、聞くだけは聞いちゃうよ～。",
            "enText": "Were you making some marvelous plans\nfor the school? Or do you want to practice\nsending letters by arrow? Whatever it is,\nI'm here to listen.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -7934226914713795401,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "うぅぅ～……ネイチャ～。\r\n実は単元テストの結果が不安で～。",
            "enText": "Uuugh… Nature… I'm so worried about\nhow I did in the unit exam…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -213022141471992223,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "…………ふむ。",
            "enText": "…Hm.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -4976753001474954839,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "普通の悩みだ……！",
            "enText": "That's a very normal concern.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 8930910100559006132,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "うぅぅ、だって心配なんだよ～。\r\n今回の範囲って難しめの内容だったから。",
            "enText": "Ooh, but I'm so worried… The material\nin the exam was pretty difficult this time.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 1309753741967948923,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "また赤点になりませんように～！\r\n補習だけは何卒～……！",
            "enText": "I really hope I didn't fail again! Please don't\nmake me do any more extra lessons…!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 3703628893499054389,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "……はぁ～、落ち着くわ～。",
            "enText": "Ahh… this is so refreshing.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -654389599006343369,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "えっ、どうして落ち着けるの！？\r\n冷静になれるコツがあるなら教えてよぉ～！",
            "enText": "What? What's so refreshing about this?!\nIf you know some secret way of calming\ndown, please teach meee!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 7837582199354457395,
            "blockIdx": 9
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780175891,
    "humanTl": true
}